<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai authorities are intensifying border negotiations with Cambodia as Prime Minister Hun Manet invites former opposition lawmaker Um Sam An to discuss disputed territory, while China‑hosted Track II talks aim for lasting peace. Environmental pressure has risen as poison from Burma flows into the Chiang Rai river basin, prompting calls for Thai action. The government is tightening price checks during the Vegetarian Festival and advancing a large‑scale power‑grid project linking Thailand with Malaysia, Myanmar and Singapore. A Filipina trafficking victim with stage‑IV breast cancer was repatriated safely from Thailand. The conflict caused 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/08/us-aircraft-carrier-abraham-lincoln-returns-to-san-diego-after-record-deployment&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/09/us-sailors-reunite-with-families-as-uss-abraham-lincoln-returns-home&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;GMA Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPM2ExS3hna1k0MnpudlotSHVaV0pkeUREdklHSFVTc1FzOGJETDVFeThJRFNveUppZExEcjA5QWgtMkhmeGVFcFBuVVNZb3BiVHhBTE1OS25Pdk5JaklSTVl2WV9YMXhxZVE3STJhN1dsUEhrT2NkeHZMSDlmTTJUWEdxSks0VEZzalJZNlFVX3pRQ0w1NF9aSnZIUHJRTGtxWndKMjVkcGlMaVRM?oc=5&quot;&gt;CamboJA News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE1nTVBqWXp5dWZyNlNsVm5PMVVCZzAzOEpIYTZJdE1EUXRPRFhYTk9aTmdFdnU5RWFXd2xGM25ySVlCQkh0dkJTYXJlM3ZtRmVxUUlwX3FwR2ljYmNjNmI1TWln?oc=5&quot;&gt;Global Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOZ1Q3MVprTUtNaDB3bEdGQ01MZ2UtaXI3OEl4RFZya1Z6OXhwczB5QmRQNnZHQVI4OUswZExyUUVHX2gyWFBIbWdEZzdtU2Rvak96Z0YzajZsdFJjTmdWcjJwa